        "answer": "PreSetup prepares CurrentNotification and sticky ownership, adding safe-area handling outside frontend. PrepareNotificationContainer attaches cooldown and100-duration polling timers, registers accept/decline actions, processes each notification-event subtype and hides a matching party invite, then subscribes to inviteResponseEvent. A visible response accepts only the literal accept string; other responses decline. IsNotificationWidgetVisible returns the raw visibility model value. Preserve opaque local polling functions and timer/native/service/cancellation gaps.",
